 "traps": [
  "the Android :app project gets React Native from the com.facebook.react Gradle plugin and Expo from autolinking in settings.gradle, which runs node to find both plugins in node_modules",
  "the iOS target Mattermost gets React Native and Expo only through ios/Podfile; the NotificationService and MattermostShare targets use neither",
  "expo-router and React Navigation are both declared and both imported",
  "detox/package.json (mattermost-mobile-e2e) has its own Jest and Express, used by the e2e harness, not by the app",
  "Maestro is not a dependency: detox/maestro holds YAML flows run by the Maestro CLI, and its package.json declares only helpers",
  "the Mattermost server the app talks to is the user's own, reached through the network client in app/client: there is no URL to find",
  "Microsoft Intune comes from the git submodule libraries/@mattermost/intune, a private repository, and only when intune_enabled is set in the Podfile",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
